---
name: terraform-best-practices.mdc
description: Best practices for Terraform configurations and AWS infrastructure
globs: **/*.tf
---

- Use modules to promote reusability and maintainability
- Implement proper state management with remote backends
- Use variables and locals to reduce duplication
- Follow naming conventions for resources and modules
- Implement proper security practices (e.g., least privilege, encryption)

---
name: aws-best-practices.mdc
description: Best practices for AWS services and architecture
globs: **/*.tf
---

- Follow the Well-Architected Framework principles
- Implement proper VPC and networking configurations
- Use IAM roles and policies for fine-grained access control
- Implement monitoring and logging with CloudWatch and CloudTrail
- Use auto-scaling and load balancing for high availability
